			"notes": "This is my 26.1.x port of the [textile_backup mod](https://github.com/Szum123321/textile_backup) by [Szum123321](https://github.com/Szum123321).\n\nI'm hosting it here as a Release until the Maintainers of the original Repo/Modrinth/Curseforge post an official version :)\n\nTHERE WERE MAJOR CHANGES SINCE THE LAST UPDATE, SO PLEASE REPORT ANY ISSUES WITH MY PORT [HERE](https://github.com/MordorsElite/textile_backup/issues)!\n\nSome credit here goes to @ku150 and [their fork](https://github.com/ku150/textile_backup) of the mod. Their 26.1 port helped me with a handful of issues I was previously unable to fix. I have to admit, I'm a little worried, because my ingame tests with my own port were all successful, but ku150 implemented a ton of additional changes I did not do. So it's very much possible that my version of the mod does not fix all the issues caused by the update to 26.1."
		},
